+	in all files.  `FTMODULE_H_COMMANDS' is used in `FTMODULE_H_CREATE'.
+
+	* src/base/rules.mk (BASE_EXT_SRC): Use BASE_EXTENSIONS.
+
+	* builds/unix/detect.mk (setup): Always execute `configure' script.
+	(have_mk): Rename to...
+	(have_Makefile): This.
