+modified,  and  distributed  under  the  terms of  the FreeType  project
+license, LICENSE.TXT.   By continuing to use, modify, or distribute this
+file you  indicate that  you have  read the  license and understand  and
+accept it fully.
+
+
+--- end of INSTALL.VMS ---
